# README.md is OWNED by the public repo (the front-door narrative) — never exported; see --into.
- README.md
# CLAUDE.public.md is exported AS CLAUDE.md (the private CLAUDE.md carries prod procedures and never crosses).
+ CLAUDE.public.md
+ CONTRIBUTING.md
+ SECURITY.md

# CLAUDE.md: a trimmed public variant is a follow-up (the private one carries prod procedures).
- CLAUDE.md
- **
